<title>SINGAPORE: Causeway major shareholder raises stake.</title>
<headline>Causeway major shareholder raises stake.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading firm Causeway Investment Ltd said on Monday a substantial shareholder, Poh Ah Tee, increased his stake in the company to 19.32 pct from 13.34 percent last Thursday.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement Poh bought 4.45 million ordinary shares for Singapore $5,591,500.</p>
<p>As a result, Poh raised the number of shares held to 14.38 million from 9.93 million.</p>
<p>On Monday, Causeway shares ended down one cent at S$1.220.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
